  {
   "n": 38,
   "html": "Classifique os triângulos quanto aos ângulos: <b>acutângulo</b> (3 ângulos agudos), <b>retângulo</b> (1 ângulo reto) ou <b>obtusângulo</b> (1 ângulo obtuso).<div><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"430\" height=\"110\" viewBox=\"0 0 430 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 84 L12 18 L96 84 Z\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M12 71 h13 v13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5506a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M150 84 L192 14 L238 84 Z\" fill=\"#ffd166\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M290 84 L366 84 L414 34 Z\" fill=\"#7fd3a0\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M376.4 73.2 A15 15 0 0 0 351 84\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5506a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"54.0\" y=\"104.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">A</text><text x=\"194.0\" y=\"104.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">B</text><text x=\"350.0\" y=\"104.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">C</text></svg></div><div class=\"grid\"><div>A) <select class=\"sel\" data-a=\"retângulo\" data-t=\"s\"><option value=\"\">escolha</option><option value=\"acutângulo\">acutângulo</option><option value=\"retângulo\">retângulo</option><option value=\"obtusângulo\">obtusângulo</option></select></div><div>B) <select class=\"sel\" data-a=\"acutângulo\" data-t=\"s\"><option value=\"\">escolha</option><option value=\"acutângulo\">acutângulo</option><option value=\"retângulo\">retângulo</option><option value=\"obtusângulo\">obtusângulo</option></select></div><div>C) <select class=\"sel\" data-a=\"obtusângulo\" data-t=\"s\"><option value=\"\">escolha</option><option value=\"acutângulo\">acutângulo</option><option value=\"retângulo\">retângulo</option><option value=\"o